<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct sugar output up 17.92 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct sugar output up 17.92 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's sugar output totalled 4.4776 million tonnes from January to October, up 17.92 percent compared with the same period last year, the Statistical Bureau said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Sugar production in October alone was 159,200 tonnes, the bureau said. It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
